WEBVTT

00:01:57.968 --> 00:02:01.274
if you had a nanoparticle that was one nanometer thick,

00:02:01.274 --> 00:02:04.089
and you put it side by side, and you had 50,000 of them,

00:02:04.089 --> 00:02:06.937
you'd be the width of a human hair.

00:02:06.937 --> 00:02:09.945
So very small, but very useful.

00:02:09.945 --> 00:02:12.849
And it's not just water that this works with.

00:02:12.849 --> 00:02:15.600
It's a lot of water-based materials like concrete,

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:17.769
water-based paint,

00:02:17.769 --> 00:02:19.417
mud,

00:02:19.417 --> 00:02:22.800
and also some refined oils as well.

00:02:27.216 --> 00:02:31.605
You can see the difference.